  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "工程倫理",
    "sub_ename": "ENGINEERING ETHICS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹工程倫理之定義,範圍,探討其與個人價值觀,宗教信仰,文化與法律之相關性.介紹中國工程師信條,工程倫理守則,即其運用在運輸交通,環境,資訊,土木工程,土地開發等.並加以案例分析.探討認知與行為之差異,面對價值衝突之兩難情境.希能協助學生建立正確之價值觀與具備正直誠信之操守。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces the definition of engineering ethics and its scopes. Then this course will discuss the relationships of engineering ethics with personal value, religion believing, culture and laws, etc. Also, it will introduce the engineer believes of Republic of China, engineering ethics' guideline, and its application on the fields of transportation, environment, information system, and civil engineering, and land development, so on. There are many case studies will be explored in the classroom such as the topics of the difference between to know and to act, the dilemma when is facing value conflict. Hopefully, the final goal is to help the students to build the right of value judgment, and keep to build the characters of righteousness and integrity.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 1.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "11.培養學生獨立或透過團隊合作解決專業問題之能力",
      "describe_en": "11. Develop students' ability to solve professional problems independently or through teamwork."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "10.培養學生具備交通工程師與從業人員應具有之專業倫理",
      "describe_en": "10. Develop students’ understanding of professional ethics for transportation engineers and practitioners."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "12.培養學生簡報製作、報告撰寫、口頭報告以及提問研討之能力",
      "describe_en": "12. Develop students' skills in presentation, report writing, oral delivery, and academic discussion."
    }
